    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the thought process, while the full image flow continues through encode, window, thought, and decode.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes features, then windows, then a compact DQ-CTM thought process updates the carrier. The repeated ticks return to the thought stage itself, not to the encoder or decoder. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across those ticks.",
